articles.description:
A lot of Expert Advisors carry a hand typed session filter: trade from 08 to 20, server time. That works until the broker changes its hours for a holiday, a symbol has a daily break, or the EA moves to a broker on a different server time zone. Then the EA sends orders into a closed market and collects TRADE_RETCODE_MARKET_CLOSED errors.
MQL5 already knows the real sessions. SymbolInfoSessionTrade returns the trading windows the broker publishes for each symbol and weekday, so the EA can ask the terminal instead of guessing.
Each weekday can have several sessions, indexed from 0. The function returns false when there are no more.
